{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o101a","title":"曹操遣自首逃役者藏匿","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o101a-account","label":"正文","text":"讨袁谭时，民因椎冰役逃亡，曹操曾禁受降；有人自首，曹操让其深藏，后来此人仍被捕。","evidence":["wudi-e-o101a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"处置逃役者","evidence":["wudi-e-o101a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"讨袁谭时","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o101a-q"]},"source_order":[1,559,"O101a"],"order":234}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o101a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e5bbdee9218f046a6889","layer":"original","quote":"初讨谭时，民亡椎冰〖7〗，﹝二﹞令不得降〖8〗。顷之，亡民有诣门首者〖9〗。公谓曰：“听汝则违令〖10〗，杀汝则诛首〖11〗。归深自藏，无为吏所获！”民垂泣而去，后竟捕得。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
